* AD8092 non-inverting amplifier, gain = 5 V/V
.lib ADI.lib

VCC VPLUS 0 5
VEE VMINUS 0 -5

VIN IN 0 SINE(0 100m 1Meg) AC 100m

XU1 IN NFB VPLUS VMINUS OUT AD8092

RG NFB 0 1k
RF OUT NFB 4k
RLOAD OUT 0 1k

CPLUS VPLUS 0 100n
CMINUS VMINUS 0 100n

.tran 0 10u 2u 2n
.ac dec 100 100k 10Meg
.meas AC gain_db FIND db(V(OUT)/V(IN)) AT=1Meg

.end
